0 Cusp Lab — rolling-gear curve machine
0 Name: cusp-lab.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under the BSD-3-Clause license; see ../licenses/cusp-lab.txt.
0 // Original native arrangement. One motor on the moving carriage, hub port A.
0 // A fixed rack and guided 16T pinion combine translation with rotation.
0 // The central holes of the yellow and orange crossbars trace a cusp and a loop.
0 // Program: one continuous forward turn and return, with the cusp inside each move.
0 // Physical marker demonstration, not a pen or SVG plotter.
0 // External standard part meshes are referenced, not embedded.
